{# Decision template: what a SexLab scene should do when its last stage is reached. Sent by
   SkyrimNet_SexLab.dll (StrategyDecision.cpp RequestLastStage) through PublicSendCustomDecisionToLLM.
   The player sees the chosen line already selected and can change it. An NPC-only scene applies the
   line when the stage time runs out. A failed or invalid answer is Stop.
   Rendered into a decisions request, never into chat messages.

   Context pushed by the game: focus_uuid, focus_name (the NPC deciding), player_in_scene, cast_names,
   timeline [lines, oldest first], options [{line, key, act, giver, receiver, part}] (the lines this NPC may pick,
   Scene.LastStage_OptionsJson; act: stop / cuddle / vaginal / oral / anal / clean / continue; giver does it to
   receiver; part: cock / pussy), victim_name / aggressor_name ("" unless the scene has a victim), prepared ("" unless a prepare just ended: then only stop and the sex it leads to are offered).
   Once an actor has reached their orgasm limit the game only offers stop / cuddle / clean (in a victim scene, only
   the victim cleaning the aggressor). The game reads the chosen key back: keep each o.key exactly as given.
   An empty options list (older game scripts) falls back to stop / cuddle / vaginal / oral / anal. #}
{% set _focus = decnpc(focus_uuid) %}
{% set _dom_slave = is_plugin_loaded("SkyrimNet_DOM.esp") and is_in_faction(focus_uuid, "DOMPlayerSlaveFaction") %}
[ state focus ]
{{ focus_name }}, {{ _focus.gender }} {{ _focus.race }}.
{{ render_character_profile("short_inline", focus_uuid) }}
[ end state ]

{% if _dom_slave %}
{% set _dom_npc.UUID = focus_uuid %}
{% set _dom_npc.name = focus_name %}
{% set _dom_args.npc = _dom_npc %}
[ state dom_instructions ]
{{ render_template("submodules\\user_final_instructions\\0551_dom_instructions", _dom_args) }}
[ end state ]

{% endif %}
[ state scene ]
{% set _sexlab = sexlab_get_threads(focus_uuid) %}
{% if existsIn(_sexlab, "threads") %}
{% for thread in _sexlab.threads %}
{% for actor_record in thread.actors %}
{% if to_number(actor_record.uuid) == focus_uuid %}
{% if existsIn(thread, "location") and thread.location != "" %}On {{ thread.location }}, {% endif %}{{ thread.description }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
With {{ cast_names }}.{% if player_in_scene %} The player is in the scene.{% else %} The player is not in the scene.{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ state timeline ]
{% if length(timeline) > 0 %}
{% for line in timeline %}
{{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Nothing has happened yet.
{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ question next choice ]
The scene has reached its last stage. Decide what {{ focus_name }} wants to happen next.
{% if _dom_slave %}Follow `dom_instructions` for how {{ focus_name }} obeys and feels; it outweighs their usual preferences.
{% endif %}Base it on what is happening (`scene`) and what {{ focus_name }} has thought, said and experienced (`timeline`), recent events over older ones.
{% if prepared != "" %}{{ prepared }} to get ready for sex: the choice is between that sex and stopping.
{% endif %}{% if victim_name != "" %}{{ victim_name }} is the victim and {{ aggressor_name }} the aggressor: the choice is the aggressor's, not the victim's.
{% else %}Stop when they are done, uncomfortable, or the scene should end. Cuddle when they want to stay close without sex.
{% endif %}[ criteria ]
{% if length(options) > 0 %}
{% for o in options %}
{% if o.act == "stop" %}{% if victim_name != "" %}{{ o.key }}: {{ aggressor_name }} has no further need of {{ victim_name }}; the scene ends
{% else %}{{ o.key }}: the scene ends
{% endif %}{% else if o.act == "cuddle" %}{% if victim_name != "" %}{{ o.key }}: {{ aggressor_name }} keeps {{ victim_name }} close to extend their dominance over them, no sex
{% else %}{{ o.key }}: stay together and cuddle, no sex
{% endif %}{% else if o.act == "clean" %}{% if victim_name != "" %}{{ o.key }}: {{ aggressor_name }} makes {{ o.giver }} clean {{ o.receiver }}'s {{ o.part }} with their mouth
{% else %}{{ o.key }}: {{ o.giver }} cleans {{ o.receiver }}'s {{ o.part }} with their mouth, no more sex
{% endif %}{% else if o.act == "continue" %}{{ o.key }}: keep going with a new animation
{% else if o.giver != "" %}{{ o.key }}: start {{ o.act }} sex, {{ o.giver }} to {{ o.receiver }}
{% else %}{{ o.key }}: start {{ o.act }} sex
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
stop: the scene ends
cuddle: stay together and cuddle, no sex
vaginal: start vaginal sex
oral: start oral sex
anal: start anal sex
{% endif %}
[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]
